        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_42ac1a33e3e041ad99b969cfb1783738",
      "statement": "Highlighting runs inside a try/catch; on Shiki failure the component logs an error and falls back to a hand-built plain pre.shiki with the default colors (#24292e background, #e1e4e8 foreground) containing HTML-escaped code, so the block still renders readable output.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/astro/CodeBlockPro.astro#L48-L56",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:25f25a73c4d6b18ecd2df42c99d5f59105b0ebdd5605a88702e33d6ccc00189a:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_5cc7bee6583f4ed59f12f35dc0feb1b2",
      "statement": "The pipeline post-processes Shiki HTML with three regex passes: background-color and (negative-lookbehind) color are extracted into the wrapper CSS variables --cbp-theme-bg and --cbp-theme-fg; the pre tag inline style is stripped to avoid !important hacks; and annotation classes or counter resets are injected — cbp-highlighted on counted line spans, and counter-reset:cbp-line startNumber-1 on the code tag when line numbers are on and startNumber is not 1 (parseInt fallback 1).",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/astro/CodeBlockPro.astro#L58-L104",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:4fba4e72f5983a4b040102670178ad919f3d6f2219bc0f827db020033a884ec8:"
        }
      ]
    },
