      "statement": "Header markup appears only when there is a filename, a non-text language badge, or a copy button; lineNumbers and copyButton tolerate string booleans (true or the string true, rejecting false or the string false); maxHeight is applied as max-height on the .cbp-scroll container; and the copy button stores the trimmed unhighlighted code in its data-code attribute.",
