      "statement": "isThemeDark adapts UI chrome to the theme: hex (3/6-digit) and rgb() colors are classified by the WCAG luminance weights 299/587/114 with a <128 dark threshold, unparseable values default to dark, and the named colors white, lightyellow, ivory, and snow are special-cased light; the result selects the cbp-theme-dark or cbp-theme-light CSS variable palette on the wrapper.",
